+| Same tester regression after coupled fix | 0 | 2 passed |
+| Producer candidate-6 native Windows fixture | 0 | 5 passed, 5 host-specific skips, 0 failures/errors in 295.103 seconds |
+| Independent tester native Windows plain accepted fixture | 0 | 1 passed, 0 skipped in 63.33 seconds; JUnit case time 60.599 seconds |
+
+The first attempt to invoke the tester Windows script exited 1 before pytest
+because the command addressed it at `C:\Users\admin` rather than its actual
