+fixture's never-run marker remained absent.
+
+Whole-module branch coverage from the focused unit suite measured 54%
+(`src/csk/builds/go_v1.py`: 3,056 statements, 1,309 missed; 1,040 branches,
+208 partial). This is below the requested 80% whole-file target, so no 80%
