+| Same tester regression after coupled fix | 0 | 2 passed |
+| Producer candidate-6 native Windows fixture | 0 | 5 passed, 5 host-specific skips, 0 failures/errors in 295.103 seconds |
+| Independent tester native Windows plain accepted fixture | 0 | 1 passed, 0 skipped in 63.33 seconds; JUnit case time 60.599 seconds |
+
+The first attempt to invoke the tester Windows script exited 1 before pytest
+because the command addressed it at `C:\Users\admin` rather than its actual
+task-root location. This was a setup-path failure and is not reported as a
+test result. The corrected invocation changed only that path and produced the
+green independent gate above.
+
+The candidate-6 full Windows fixture exercised all three accepted build
+variants plus the hidden-literal and runtime-image mutation negatives. The
+separate tester run repeated the plain accepted case against the installed
+wheel and fixed Go tree with no skip. The source-aware process reached exactly
