+
+| Command | Exit | Result |
+|---|---:|---|
+| `task-board --version` | 0 | `task-board 0.23.0` |
+| `git --version` | 0 | `git 2.50.1` |
+| `rg --version` | 0 | `ripgrep 15.2.0` |
