+| `.venv/bin/python -m mypy --version` | 0 | Project environment has `mypy 2.3.0` |
+| `ssh -V` | 0 | `OpenSSH_10.2p1` |
+| `ssh ... win hostname` | 0 | Native host reachable as `DESKTOP-3PBO632` |
+
+## Failure evidence
