+
+Whole-module branch coverage from the focused unit suite measured 54%
+(`src/csk/builds/go_v1.py`: 3,093 statements, 1,313 missed; 1,050 branches,
+214 partial). This is below the requested 80% whole-file target, so no 80%
+coverage claim is made and the corresponding board checklist item remains
+unchecked. The cycle-5 failure/fix paths themselves are directly covered by
+the tester regression and native fixtures.
