 ### 2026-07-30 — Fixed go-v1 compile-driver cycle-4 review finds an unbound interpreter runtime
 - REVIEWER: `TASK-260720-2g21eg` cycle 4 on CocoaSkills base `495ad021847529ce5a544dba415ca2fe19949539`; the clean local main clone and live `origin/main` matched, both dependency handoffs were accepted, and the reviewed wheel matched the candidate `go_v1.py` and `cli.py` hashes. No CocoaSkills product or test file was modified.
