 - GREEN SCOPE: the repaired Windows permission regressions passed natively and under a forced one-bit Windows identity; a negative control proved both tests detect disabled foreign-mode rejection. The prior 14 lock-integrity regressions, 13 contract cases, focused 129-test suite, strict mypy 2.1/2.3, Ruff, and package build passed.
 - CONCURRENCY FINDING: full Python 3.14 pytest failed `test_repeated_concurrent_home_consumers_survive_release_handoffs` (`1 failed, 807 passed, 58 skipped`), and fresh-process stress reproduced it on iteration 4. A six-second faulthandler dump showed same-home consumer threads still rescanning directory entries in `_canonicalize_darwin_existing_path` before `_ExclusiveFileLock.__enter__` starts its configured timeout.
